ake Placid"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/1049"} "29 from 15 countries"]]] [:tr {:class "records", :style ""} [:th {:style "vertical-align: top;"} "Olympic Record "] [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/1023"} "7:22.4"] " " [:span {:class "label label-primary"} "WR"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/92057"} "Fred Anton Maier"] " " [:a {:href "/countries/NOR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/NOR.png"}] "NOR"] " / 15 February 1968 / " [:a {:href "/records/event_name/533"} "Details"]]] [:tr {:class "referees", :style ""} [:th {} "Starter"] [:td {:style "width: 400px"}] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/UNK"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/UNK.png"}] "UNK"]]] [:tr {:class "referees", :style ""} [:th {} "Referee"] [:td {:style "width: 400px"} [:a {:href "/athletes/5002203"} "Georg Pettersson"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SWE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SWE.png"}] "SWE"]]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} [:a {:href "/athletes/86551"} "Eric Heiden"] " had one gold medal, having already won the 500 metres, and was also favored at this distance. He had won the last three World All-Arounds, and won the 5,000 at that meet in both 1978 and 1979. He had only lost the distance one time in 1978-79 at a major meet. His biggest competition was expected to come from the Norwegian, " [:a {:href "/athletes/97829"} "Kai Arne Stenshjemmet"] ". Stenshjemmet was the world record holder, with 6:56.9, set at Medeo in March 1977. He had been third at the 1979 World All-Around, and fourth in 1978, and was better at longer distances. Norway’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/96122"} "Tom Erik Oxholm"] " started in the first pair and recorded 7:05.59, a mark for Heiden to shoot at in the second pair. Skating with Dutchman " [:a {:href "/athletes/98531"} "Hilbert van der Duim"] ", Heiden was two seconds in front after 4½ laps, and defeated van der Duim by over five seconds, posting 7:02.29. It gave Stenshjemmet a goal and he set his lap times accordingly. Thru 10 laps he was ahead of Heiden’s pace, but at 4,200 metres he trailed by 1/100th of a second, and that was it. He had little left, and fell back a full second on the last two laps. Heiden had his second gold, but Stenshjemmet did hang on for the silver medal, with Oxholm getting bronze."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button131339", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button131339').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Pair"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "200 m"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "600 m"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "1000 m"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "1400 m"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "1800 m"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "2200 m"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "2600 m"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "3000 m"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "3400 m"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "3800 m"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "4200 m"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "4600 m"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "2I"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/86551"} "Eric Heiden"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "7:02.29"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "19.54"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "52.08"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "1:25.25"] [